\b\fs24 3.01 - Temple of Lost Time\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\b0\fs22\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar The door is tightly shut. It doesn't appear to have a keyhole, but there is a curiously shaped indentation in its centre...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell Hold on, [pc]! Are we really leaving?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell I really think we should take a look around. Who knows\emdash we might find something interesting...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Erik\cell Is this meant to be art? It just looks like some weird old guy with a funny face to me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell Isn't it just amazing, honey? The way it defies artistic convention to make such a bold statement!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell All the stuff around here is so unique! Whoever made it all was a genius! Such an eye for shape and form...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell Let's take a closer look at all this stuff. Who knows what we might find...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell I was just having a wee nose around when I found a dusty auld tome that caught my attention.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell Remember what we saw back in the Temple of Dawn? When you channelled the power of the seedlings and we saw all those scenes from Erdwin's life?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell Well, it looks to me like this book is about those same events. But what would something like that be doing lying round in an auld ruin like this?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell Her Highness is correct. This looks like the place where we met the Watcher.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell But I have never heard of ruins like these in this area...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar It's a very ancient-looking mural. It depicts some small, white beings offering up what look like balls of light.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar There's a strangely shaped indentation in the centre.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell [pc], don't you think we should take a look at the old tower north of Yggdrasil that Erik told us about?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell We could use the Calamus flute to call Cetacea, and then fly right to it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar The door is tightly shut. It doesn't appear to have a keyhole, but there's a curiously shaped indentation in its centre.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Try inserting the Wheel of Time into the indentation? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Erik\cell Have you thought this through, [pc]?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Erik\cell You heard the Timekeeper\emdash if you go back there, that's it. No way home. And there's no guarantee you'll even make it to where you want to go.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Erik\cell Are you sure you want to do this? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell I'm sorry, [pc], but you simply can't do this! We won't let you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell When I cut my hair and Veronica gave me her powers, I vowed that I would use them to carry on our sacred mission and protect you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell If I were to let anything happen to you, she would never forgive me. So I have no choice but to stop you from doing this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell Darling, don't you feel you've done enough? I mean, you defeated the Lord of Shadows, didn't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell I don't want to lose anybody else\endash I don't think I could bear it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell I let you go once. And I promised I'd never do it again.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell Please, don't do this... I... I don't want to lose you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell Fate seems to have a habit of snatching away those I care about most...but not this time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell Save a tired auld man more heartache than he can bear, will ye? If I lose you too, I'll... I don't know what I'll do...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell I cannot permit you to do this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell ...Curse it all! Why can I not go!? Why can I not put a stop to Mordegon!? Must I really remain here, idle, while you risk all for the sake of our fallen companion!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar If you climb these steps, there's no going back. Are you sure you want to return to the past? [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Erik\cell But do NOT mess this up! Go back there and save her, you hear? Save us all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell ...I understand why you want to do this. How could I not? And I can see that your mind is made up.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Serena\cell So I suppose I must let you go, much as it pains me. Good luck, [pc]... We shall miss you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell Trust Erik to upstage me like that! Honestly! But he's right\emdash it's clear we won't be able to talk you out of this. And I've realised something...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell I want everybody in the world to be happy, right? So why should all those poor darlings in the past miss out, huh? That just wouldn't be fair.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Sylvando\cell So you go back there, and you make them smile, you hear? Every single one of them! I know you can do it, honey!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell All I ever wanted was to protect you, [pc]. Maybe that's why it's hard for me to imagine you fighting this battle alone...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Jade\cell But I know you can do it. I believe in you\emdash we all do. Now go and save the world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell Ho ho! Don't look so down in the mouth, laddie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Rab\cell You're a big boy now, so chin up! Believe in yourself, and there's nothing you can't do!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell I only wish I could fell Mordegon with my own hand. It pains me to leave this to you, [pc].\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Hendrik\cell But I know that you have the strength to save this world. You are the Luminary, and I believe in you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar The Timekeeper\cell Join me by the Sphere when you are ready...\cell\row 
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\b\fs24\par
3.02 - Arboria\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\b0\fs22\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar It would probably be better to stay and see what's going on in Arboria.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This path leads to the top of the mountain. It is a sacred place, where none may set foot without the Holy Father's permission. Forgive me, but I must ask that you turn back.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah, Luminary. What brings you all the way out here? Your companions are all gathered in the cathedral.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am sure that Father Benedictus will be concerned to see that you are not with them. Return to him, I prithee.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Luminary, you seem somewhat perturbed. Does aught ail you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Hm? You wish to know what day it is today? What an odd question.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Why, today is the day that you and your companions will offer the sacred Orbs to the altar in the First Forest and journey to Yggdrasil, of course! Everyone is waiting for you in the cathedral!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We are blessed with soil of a most wondrous richness, from which spring forth some of Erdrea's most fragrant herbs and delicious vegetables.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Is there something on your mind, Luminary? You look as if you have just awoken from a long and troubled dream...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear you will be journeying to Yggdrasil today. Father Benedictus and your companions await you in the cathedral.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The sigil on your hand is known in the legends as the Mark of Light. It is said to symbolise the bond between the Luminary and the World Tree.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you were to visit Her holy Heart and offer up the Mark, I do not doubt that mighty Yggdrasil would make Her will known to you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I had thought you would have gone to the cathedral with your friends. Wherefore do you wander the village alone?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Your absence must be a source of some concern. Return to them without delay, I prithee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My, what an unusual sword you carry. It seems far too foreboding a weapon for the blessed Luminary.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: That said, you seem a little different yourself, [pc]... Stronger, somehow...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My wife and I have been happily married for many years, but try as we might, the heavens did not bless us with a child. I had almost made my peace with the thought that I would never be a father.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But now, at long last, my beloved has borne me a beautiful baby boy! Ahh, I have never known such happiness!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: 'Tis strange... When I gaze upon the smiling face of my newborn son, I feel sharp pangs of sorrow...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: As if I have known his loss... As if he was taken from me...once, long ago... But I must banish such evil thoughts from my mind!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Fidelus\cell Ah, [pc]. Are you looking for Veronica and Serena? They were looking for you. You must have just missed one another.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Fidelus\cell My little angels told me that you vanished right in front of their eyes just as Father Benedictus was addressing you all in the cathedral. But this cannot possibly be true\emdash a trick of the light, perhaps...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Alma\cell Luminary, the responsibilities of your role no doubt weigh heavily upon your shoulders. I trust that my daughters will do all they can to lighten that burden.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My sister has quite the aptitude for spellcasting, but little interest in honing her talent. How I wish she would take a leaf out of your book.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: After all, if the worst were to happen and she were forced to fight, knowing the right spell might mean the difference between life and death!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Frizz... Bang... Crack... And the one I learned the other day...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Waaah! I did not see you there, Luminary! Please, don't look\emdash it shames me for a mighty warrior like you to see me studying such simple spells!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
