\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone was so worried about you, you know. Especially your poor mother. After you left, she was a nervous wreck.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
