\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The descent of Erdwin's Lantern caused the worst sandstorm Gallopolis has ever experienced. I was certain that no one would survive.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And now this dark star appears... It is truly miraculous that we have not yet perished. We must consider ourselves fortunate.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
