\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The ringmaster always told us that it's at times like these that people need the circus the most, but the truth is, I couldn't hack it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I mean, no matter how passionate I am about performing, or how attached I am to the show, I'm not going to risk my life for it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I could not bear to live with the dark star hanging ominously above me, so I decided to flee the city with my family. I would advise you to do the same.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
