\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I do not wish to be forced to witness the destruction of our ancient city, but surely there is nothing that can be done...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
