\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I won't tell you how long I've been trawling through these ruins looking for something valuable, but it was long enough to make me want to throw in the treasure hunting towel.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Anyway, I was shifting some rubble out of the way, and I found some stairs leading down to what looked like a dungeon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Trouble is, there's a really spooky voice coming from down there\emdash some poor fellow wailing about how much pain he's in...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm pretty sure it must be the ghost of someone who was trapped when Dundrasil was destroyed. Which means I won't be going looking for riches down there in a hurry... (shiver)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sounds like that awful voice has shut up at last. Was that something to do with you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Anyway, it doesn't matter. I've decided to give the old treasure hunting game a rest. I'm leaving the ghosts of Dundrasil in peace...for now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar The door won't budge.\cell\row 
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\par
\b\fs24 3.10 - Puerto Valor\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\b0\fs22\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This mountain used to be sealed off, but we've received new orders from Heliodor telling us not to stop people going up there any more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I mean, it makes sense\emdash it was Sir Jasper who issued the order to blockade it in the first place, and he's gone missing, so...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You have noticed too, se\'f1or? Ever since Erdwin's Lantern descended toward Gallopolis, we have been observing the monsters growing wilder and wilder.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I worry about Puerto Valor, and my little hermanita who lives there. Ay, I wish that I could return there and check that my dear sister is okay...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: 'Ard to believe, ain't it? A landslide, openin' a way through 'ere.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It's funny, though... I'm sure this ain't the first time it's 'appened. Don't ask me why. It's just a weird feelin' I've got.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It's funny, though... I'm sure this ain't the first time we've 'ad a landslide openin' a way through the valley. Don't ask me why I fink that. It's just a weird feelin' I've got.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: \'a1Hola, se\'f1or! \'a1Bienvenido a Puerto Valor! Don Rodrigo returned to us a short while ago. You must go and see him as soon as possible, por favor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar There's no response. He's lost in the music.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I came here hoping to speak with Don Rodrigo, and it seems my timing is perfecto\emdash he has just returned from a journey.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Rumour has it that he suffered an injury on the way home, but this will not stop him from granting me an audience. He is too macho for that! \'a1Que hombre! What a man!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome to Puerto Valor, the city of blossoms and sea breeze! No one has bluer water or whiter sands than we do! \'a1No se\'f1or!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Although I confess that the atmosphere here is a little...subdued at the moment. It is because of la estrella oscura\emdash the dark star that hangs over Gallopolis...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Don Rodrigo has returned from his trip to Heliodor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Unfortunately, they say he was injured in a battle against a vicious monster on his way back. I imagine he's probably resting up at home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay... Ever since the dark star appeared over Gallopolis, everyone in town has been on edge, ready to flee at any moment... But I think that times like these require a cool head\emdash una cabeza fr\'eda, s\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hooray! Don Rodrigo is back! He is the kindest and strongest hombre in all of Erdrea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Zzz... The dark star... La estrella oscura... Zzz... I am scared... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I come from a snowy country in the far north. It was a very long journey, but it was worth it! Everything is so fresh and clean here! Ahh, I will never tire of it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I even saw a huge black mass glowing in the sky to the south-east of here! I have never seen such a thing back at home!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A short while ago, a sinister wind blew through Puerto Valor from the south-east. I have never experienced anything like it before...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I can't believe it! A dark star has appeared above Gallopolis! It's all very terrifying...but Don Rodrigo will look after us, I'm sure!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A dark star has risen in the east, s\'ed? Then why is the sea so still? I hope this is not the calm before the storm...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: No matter how desperate our situation grows, as long as we have Don Rodrigo on our side, we will prevail. \'a1Viva Puerto Valor! \f1\u9834?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: According to the rumours, the dark star is truly enormous\emdash muy, muy grande! If it came down upon Puerto Valor, we would have no chance of escaping. No, se\'f1or...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: And besides, if we leave town, we will surely be killed by the vicious monsters that roam around outside anyway. Surely it is better to stay here and hope for the best, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When my children heard about Erdwin's Lantern descending toward Gallopolis, the little devils were thrilled! I shall have to try my hardest to help them see that this is nothing to crow about...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My husband and I have decided that the best way to deal with the dark star that has appeared over Gallopolis is to try and get as far away from it as possible.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Wheee! The big star is falling! Falling onto our heads! Wheee... CRASH!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar She seems to be fast asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Erdwin's Lantern fell out of the sky! Imagine the massive crash it must have made!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar He seems to be fast asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Why worry about the dark star? There's nothing piddling little humans like us can do about it anyway. We might as well stay here in Puerto Valor and enjoy ourselves while we can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is just between you and me, but I heard that Sir Jasper was working for the monsters.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Which means that when soldiers like me were following his orders, we were doing what the monsters wanted us to do. It's pretty scary when you think about it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Gosh... Look at her go! It's nights like this that make me glad to be alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone's talking about Erdwin's Lantern falling onto Gallopolis. Some people are saying it's the end of the world, but I just don't know what to believe...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I am very worried about the fate of the world, what with Erdwin's Lantern falling toward Gallopolis and all...but I can't just sit around fretting all the time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I mean, a girl's got to try and enjoy herself once in a while!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I really haven't been able to relax ever since that dark star appeared above Gallopolis. That's why I'm out looking for seashells now. I'm trying to calm myself down...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Watching this beautiful dancing helps keep my mind off that awful dark star...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that a dark star has appeared above a foreign kingdom, s\'ed? Bien. Then I must dance better than ever, se\'f1or. It is at sorrowful times like these that people most need a distraction.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I will perform on the beach tonight as usual. You should come along. You will leave with a smile on your face, I promise. \'a1Je je je!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that a dark star has appeared above a foreign kingdom, s\'ed? Bien. Then I must dance better than ever, se\'f1or. It is at sorrowful times like these that people most need a distraction.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: So come on\emdash you must dance with me, s\'ed? (clack clack clack) \'a1Ol\'e9! \f1\u9834?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A dull glow in the south-eastern sky, and a terribly strong wind from the same direction\emdash that is the direction of Gallopolis, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay, I fear for that poor kingdom... For the whole world, in fact... It has been so peaceful for so long, but... (sigh)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The sea is filled with terrible monsters...but you have no need to worry! My armour will always keep you safe! Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Hola, se\'f1or. You have seen the huge mountain to the north of town, s\'ed? It is called Mount Pang Lai. People say it is a holy place.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Until not so long ago, some hombres from Heliodor prevented people from climbing it, but I hear that anyone is free to do so now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: La estrella oscura\emdash the dark star, s\'ed? It has appeared above Gallopolis, many miles away on the other side of the ocean, but we can still sense its eerie presence here in Puerto Valor...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Normally I would trust the mighty desert caballeros of Gallopolis to counter any threat...but this time, se\'f1or, I am not so certain... Ay ay ay...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We're visiting Puerto Valor on our honeymoon. We were supposed to head to Gallopolis next, but after that dark star appeared, we decided to change our plans.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You've heard about what's happened in Gallopolis, haven't you? The city to the south-east of here?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: People are saying that this is going to bring about the end of the world... Oh, it's just too terrifying...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone is terrified that the world is going to end. And you know what people do at times like this, se\'f1or? ...S\'ed, they drink! \'a1Salud!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The appearance of the dark star has made the monsters more vicious than ever, se\'f1or. Muy vicioso... You must be careful if you venture outside of the town, s\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is the villa of Don Rodrigo. He is the most famous and honoured hombre in Puerto Valor. He has just recently returned following a trip to Heliodor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...But unfortunately, he was attacked by monsters on his way back, and is badly injured. You may enter the villa, of course, but do not cause any trouble for him, por favor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Do you know Heliodor, se\'f1or? That is where Don Rodrigo's family came from originally. He is the descendant of a legendary swordsman who hailed from that city.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is why they say that he is able to access the Kingsbarrow, where the royals of Heliodor are laid to rest. Ay, but this is only a story we are told. Un rumor local, \'bfs\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ay ay ay... I had heard that the monsters had become more vicious, but vicious enough to injure Don Rodrigo so badly!? \'a1No lo creo! It is unbelievable!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Come! The monsters are getting more powerful by the day! The only way we stand a chance of beating them is if we train harder than ever!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...What's that? You want me to train you? Ha! You wouldn't last five minutes, trust me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I used to be in the Heliodorian army, you know. I actually fought alongside Sir Hendrik himself, back when the monsters attacked Dundrasil.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was already too late by the time we arrived on the scene, though. There was nothing we could do to stop them. So much was lost that day...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It left me feeling so empty... So when Don Rodrigo invited me here to become an instructor, I jumped at the chance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Gonzalez\cell Espere, se\'f1or\emdash please wait. These are the chambers of Don Rodrigo.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
