\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Don Rodrigo\cell But mere victory will not suffice. No\emdash Norberto and Hendrik must show true unity. They must perform the Executioner together, and with it strike the final blow that fells each beast.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
