\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Don Rodrigo\cell If they succeed, they will be rewarded with one of the most powerful weapons ever created. I wish you both luck, my caballeros! \'a1Buena suerte!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Not only did Se\'f1orito Norberto return after being missing for many years, but the handsome Sir Hendrik came with him too! Ay, this is the greatest day of my life! \'a1Un d\'eda perfecto!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Servantes\cell Mi querido Norberto... My dear boy... It is so wonderful to see you again! I have been waiting so long for you to return!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Servantes\cell And although he may not show it, I know that Don Rodrigo also feels the same. It is a pleasure to be able to welcome you home, se\'f1orito!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Servantes\cell It is a shame you must leave for the Kingsbarrow so soon after arriving. Please be careful there. I fear it is a very dangerous place. Muy peligrosa...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
