\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...And we also have Don Rodrigo, fit and healthy once again! Ay, it makes me so happy to see him out there training with the young caballeros! \'a1Muy feliz!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Don Rodrigo has returned from his trip to Heliodor! Not only that, he's recovered from his injuries and is putting the young knights-in-training through their paces again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ohh, I really can't wait until I'm allowed to start training with him. He's going to make a great knight of me, I just know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You know, se\'f1or, hearing that Norberto had come home suddenly reminded me of something\emdash a circus that came here to Puerto Valor many years ago.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You see, it was right around the time it was here that Norberto ran away from home. I never thought about it before, but maybe there is a connection, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is the way to the villa of Don Rodrigo. He has returned from his trip to the Kingsbarrow.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Feel free to enter the villa, but remember to behave appropriately, s\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: S\'ed, I had heard people talk about the wonderful performer by the name of Sylvando, but never did I think that he was in fact Se\'f1orito Norberto! \'a1No se\'f1or!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
