\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This is it! It's time to show Don Rodrigo everything you've learned in training! No slacking now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...Hm? Oh, you're Norberto's friend, aren't you? Listen, would you mind sticking around and watching the training for a while? It'll spur the lads on a bit, I reckon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10356 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I just can't imagine how Don Rodrigo felt when Norberto came back after all those years away. I mean, he's the only family he's got...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
