\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The other day, the fishing fleet got attacked by monsters. All the boys made it back\emdash except Kai...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
