\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sure, Kai wasn't the friendliest guy, and there were times when he fought with the other sailors, but he was one of us. This village won't be the same without him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
