\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I ran up a masshive tab while the bartender was away... Hmm? Why are you looking at me like that, please? You thought I was shtealing my drinksh!? How dare you! Hic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah! It is very, very good to see you! I heard that you are the one who lifted the dancing curse! Ho ho! You are the saviour of Phnom Nonh, I think so!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now we have many, many reasons for tourists to visit\emdash the ancient ruins, the cursed mural...and our newest attraction, the Phenomenal Phnom Nonh Parade!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Yes, sir! We are performing the dance that the monster taught us in order to attract visitors to the village! It is Mony's idea, and it is a very, very good one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Yes, I am sure that Phnom Nonh will continue to grow into Erdrea's greatest little tourist destination\emdash and it is all thanks to you, sir! Ho ho!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Mayor said I had a natural talent for dancing, so I have decided to practise very, very hard and impress the tourists who visit Phnom Nonh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Apparently, people from the city like dancing very, very much. I do not understand it, but still... Hustle! Hustle!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Dancing in front of people would be very, very embarrassing, I thought so. But actually it was so, so much fun! Perhaps I should be a dancer instead of a nun...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have lived a long, long life, but I have never seen anything more hellish than all those people being forced to dance like that. It was a real nightmare!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is a very, very big relief to me to see the village back to normal once again. And it is all because of what you did. Thank you, sir.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: A long, long time ago, Phnom Nonh was a peaceful village where nothing happened, but then we discovered the ruins and the mural, and the village changed a lot.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Now it has changed again, I think so. Things will not be the same after what happened with the dancing curse. I suppose this is how history is made...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Traveler\cell Ah! There you are! Son told me that you are the one who defeated the monster and saved Phnom Nonh! Our future is safe now, I think so!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Traveler\cell And perhaps you have already heard, but Mony has thought of a very, very good idea for attracting more tourists to the village! Finally, I am excited for the future!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Traveler\cell I must say a very, very big thank you to you. If it were not for you and your heroic actions, our village would already be history, I think so!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Traveler\cell Perhaps you have already heard, but Mony has thought of a very, very good idea for attracting more tourists to the village! Finally, I am excited for the future!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Traveler\cell I must say a very, very big thank you to you. If it were not for you and your heroic actions, our village would already be history, I think so!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10308 
