\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ah-phew... Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I have lived in this village for many long years, but ne'er before have I seen such an ill-omened sky. The evil in the air prickles at my very skin.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If the darkness were to take an old man like me, I would have no regrets, but you and your friends are yet young\emdash for your sakes, I pray that these benighted days do not last.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Just as Erdwin's Lantern falls from the sky, we welcome a new life into the village...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I know not what this event portends, but I pray that this latest leaf to spring forth upon Yggdrasil's all-embracing boughs is able to grow strong and lives long...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This path leads to Luminary's Landing. Father Benedictus has instructed me that you and your friends are free to pass. Go forth with my blessing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Well met, honoured Luminary! You seem a little tired\emdash perhaps you would like to rest here in my humble hostelry awhile?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Benedictus\cell The staff that I gave you is the legendary Sceptre of Time\emdash the favoured weapon of the holy sage Serenica. Alas, the elements have not been kind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Benedictus\cell Perhaps, if you could find the necessary instructions, you might be able to restore it to its former glory using that forge of yours.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10380 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar Benedictus\cell The legends tell of Serenica's erstwhile companion Drustan the Brave having been a skilled blacksmith. Might he have left behind some clue as to the Sceptre's composition?\cell\row 
\pard\nowidctlpar\sa200\sl276\slmult1\cf0\par
\b\fs24 3.16 - Angri-La\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cf1\b0\fs22\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The path to the summit is beset by monsters. If you mean to head up there yourself, you would do well to keep your wits about you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1742\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote\emdash  Message from the High Lama \emdash\par
\par
Disciples of Angri-La, the Grand Master has requested that I share an important piece of information with you. \par
\par
\lquote Some days ago, Grand Master Pang discovered Lord Robert drawing a crude image on the covenant stone. By way of punishment, his buttocks were beaten until they shone like the setting sun.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\lquote Let this be a warning to you, fellow disciples\emdash do not stray from the righteous path, lest you meet with the same painful fate.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Can it be...? Tell me, wanderer\emdash are you [pc], crown prince of Dundrasil?  [yes/no]\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is no coincidence that you have come to this temple just as the dark star has risen. No doubt the threads of fate led you here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: All of the grown-up disciples have gathered in the Field of Discipline to welcome the Luminary. They say that the day we have awaited for so many years has finally come.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: But what exactly is a Luminary? I will ask my mother later...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Everyone is very excited that the Luminary's here. Whoever he is, he must be very important. Personally, I'm more of a fan of the Red-Cheeked Seeker myself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He was the Grand Master's most devoted disciple, and everyone says he was really, really tough! When I grow up, I want to be just like him!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Luminary. We have been awaiting your arrival for many years.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: One of us is especially eager to meet you\emdash the Grand Master has been looking forward to making your acquaintance ever since the day of your birth!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I just saw a load of disciples racing into the Field of Discipline. The Grand Master must have summoned them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I've never seen them so excited before. I wonder what's going on...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Luminary. This is the High Hall of Angri-La. The Grand Master awaits you in the Field of Discipline\emdash the training ground behind this building.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This man is a soldier of Heliodor. For many months, he and his comrades manned the barricade which cut Angri-La off from the rest of the world.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When first he arrived in the temple we were wary of his intentions, but now we know that he is a man of peace. Treat him with kindness, I pray.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When the order came through to abandon the siege, I thought I'd come up here to see what all the fuss was about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: For months on end, we'd been told these people were enemies of Heliodor. I was worried that they might attack me on sight, but instead they welcomed me with open arms.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Sir Jasper told us that this temple was a hive of villainy, but that can't be true\emdash these people have been nothing but kind.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I had heard that they believed in all that \lquote love your enemy\rquote  stuff, but I didn't believe it until I saw it for myself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My friend was chosen to be the new High Lama. Now he's the most important person in Angri-La after the Grand Master, and all the grown-ups have to do what he says!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Amazing, isn't it? He's only the same age as me, but we couldn't be more different!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Luminary. This is the Grand Master's Hall\emdash home of Grand Master Pang, the spiritual leader of Angri-La.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you had come here when you were a child and trained with us as you were supposed to, this is where you would have awoken each morning.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\rquote We two sworn companions, Erdwin and Morcant, do hereby pledge to lay low the Dark One, though it cost us our very lives. May this pact stand from now until eternity.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Welcome, Prince of Dundrasil, to the Field of Discipline, where your ancestors trained to become mighty warriors and wise rulers. The Grand Master awaits you within.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Will you be testing yourself against the Wheel of Harma today, Luminary? If you wish to undertake this most gruelling of trials, please proceed to the Field of Discipline.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that the monsters are running rampant all over Erdrea. Many lives have already been lost, and the survivors are plagued by fear and confusion.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It is your duty\emdash your destiny, in fact\emdash to restore hope to those who remain. We are counting on you, Luminary.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The view from the balcony is breathtaking, is it not? It is up to us to ensure that these lands beneath us are never lost to the darkness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Ever since my mother first told me about the Red-Cheeked Seeker, the Grand Master's most famous disciple, he's been my hero.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I always imagined him to be a massive muscleman with bulging biceps and a bushy black beard, but he's just a doddery old man... It's come as a little bit of a shock...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: It was a real shock to find out my childhood hero was just a normal old man. But he's still the Red-Cheeked Seeker, disciple of legend! He might not look it, but he must be amazing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Grand Master has accepted me as a disciple. I won't start training properly until I'm older, but for now, I've decided to walk up and down these stairs to build up my stamina.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I'm going to train as hard as I can so that one day, I can be just as impervious to pain as the Red-Cheeked Seeker!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: At long last, your training under the Grand Master has begun. It will be a difficult task indeed to catch up on so much in so short a time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Do not worry\emdash Grand Master Pang's methods may be harsh, but no disciple has ever lost his life to them...yet! Tee hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The Grand Master tells us that a beast of world-shattering strength has been reborn. Though this may seem cause to fear, I fear not.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: After all, we have you and Lord Robert on our side\emdash the most distinguished disciples of the great Grand Master Pang herself! So long as you are with us, I know that humanity will prevail!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: We saw Erdwin's Lantern fall from the sky. It was frightening enough to see such a thing from half the world away\emdash I cannot imagine how terrified the people of Gallopolis must have been.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: My son thought of abandoning his training, but after seeing the frenzied monsters attacking people left and right, he has had a change of heart.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: He has sworn to redouble his efforts, so that he might protect his people from harm. Once he was a mewling child, but now he is a man at last!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: I hear that you have begun your training already. You are eager to catch up with your forefathers, hm? That is admirable indeed. But it is to be expected\emdash you are the Luminary, after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The ancient teachings of Angri-La tell us that the souls of those who lose their lives pass into the void\emdash the chasm between this life and the next.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: ...What!? You say that you have been there yourself? For one so young to pass into the great beyond and return to tell the tale is nothing short of a miracle. None but the Luminary could achieve such a feat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Please, let me become a disciple and train with you! I want to become a mighty warrior and fight back against the monsters!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: The High Lama let me test my strength against the Wheel of Harma, but I failed to complete even the very first cycle...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Is there anyone in the world who can complete the entire trial? I've been training my whole life, but I didn't even come close...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Grand Master Pang awaits you in the Field of Discipline. She has prepared a special training regime for you: an ancient ritual known as the Wheel of Harma.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: If you should wish to hone your physical and spiritual strength, please go to her. But I warn you\emdash it will not be easy.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: This warrior wishes to become a disciple of Angri-La. Normally, we would not allow outsiders to join us, but given the grave state of the world, we cannot turn him away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Desperate times call for desperate measures. So long as he is willing and able to train, Angri-La will welcome him with open arms.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: When Erdwin's Lantern fell, the monsters grew more malevolent than ever before. Even we, the disciples of the great Grand Master Pang, struggle to keep them at bay.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Only you, Luminary, have the strength to save our world. I pray that you achieve your destiny.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: Until now, I was convinced that you were the Darkspawn, a being of purest evil who would bring ruin to our realm...but now I see that I was wrong.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar *: You were fighting to save this world with all your might. And you continue to do so even now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1440\cellx10332 
\pard\intbl\nowidctlpar\qr\cell 
